<mxfile><diagram id="diff" name="diff"><mxGraphModel grid="0" page="0" background="#FFFFFF"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="notes" value="WF-06 Demo scenarios: 33 thay đổi. Xanh lá = thêm · Đỏ = xoá · Vàng cam = đổi; phần còn lại làm mờ.&lt;br&gt;• Đổi nhãn: Sign report → Review report&lt;br&gt;• Thêm activity “Finish saves, validate data, reserve number and prepare PDF”&lt;br&gt;• Thêm system activity “Store signed PDF”&lt;br&gt;• Đổi nhãn: Number report → Keep final internal approval bound to reviewed PDF&lt;br&gt;• Đổi nhãn: Sign PDF → Digitally sign the reviewed PDF&lt;br&gt;• Đổi nhãn: Issue report → Issue report and make reserved number official&lt;br&gt;• Thêm activity “[report edit permission] Edit the DOCX draft in ONLYOFFICE”&lt;br&gt;• Đổi nhãn: DS-06a Main: report issued and delivered → DS-06a Main: report issued and delivered ↔ WF-06 Main path&lt;br&gt;• Thêm system activity “Store signed PDF”&lt;br&gt;• Đổi nhãn: Sign report → Review report&lt;br&gt;• Đổi nhãn: Issue report → Issue report and make reserved number official&lt;br&gt;• Thêm system activity “Keep final internal approval bound to reviewed PDF”&lt;br&gt;• Thêm system activity “Digitally sign the reviewed PDF”&lt;br&gt;• Đổi nhãn: DS-06b Lab head rejects the draft report → DS-06b Lab head rejects the draft report ↔ WF-06-E2&lt;br&gt;• Đổi nhãn: Sign report → Review report&lt;br&gt;• Đổi nhãn: Queue signing → Digitally sign the reviewed PDF&lt;br&gt;• Đổi nhãn: Issue report → Issue report and make reserved number official&lt;br&gt;• Thêm system activity “Keep final internal approval bound to reviewed PDF”&lt;br&gt;• Thêm system activity “Store signed PDF”&lt;br&gt;• Đổi nhãn: DS-06c Viettel Sign unreachable → DS-06c Viettel Sign unreachable ↔ WF-06-E1&lt;br&gt;• Đổi đầu cạnh: ● initial node “All results approved” → activity “Sign report” → ● initial node “All results approved” → activity “[report edit permission] Edit the DOCX draft in ONLYOFFICE”&lt;br&gt;• Đổi đầu cạnh: activity “Sign report” → system activity “Issue report” → activity “Review report” → system activity “Keep final internal approval bound to reviewed PDF”&lt;br&gt;• Đổi đầu cạnh: activity “Sign report” → system activity “Queue signing” → activity “Review report” → system activity “Keep final internal approval bound to reviewed PDF”&lt;br&gt;• Đổi đầu cạnh: system activity “Retry when online” → system activity “Issue report” → system activity “Retry when online” → system activity “Store signed PDF”&lt;br&gt;• Thêm activity “[report edit permission] Edit the DOCX draft in ONLYOFFICE” → activity “Finish saves, validate data, reserve number and prepare PDF”&lt;br&gt;• Thêm activity “Finish saves, validate data, reserve number and prepare PDF” → activity “Review report”&lt;br&gt;• Thêm system activity “Store signed PDF” → system activity “Issue report and make reserved number official”&lt;br&gt;• Thêm system activity “Keep final internal approval bound to reviewed PDF” → system activity “Digitally sign the reviewed PDF”&lt;br&gt;• Thêm system activity “Digitally sign the reviewed PDF” → system activity “Store signed PDF”&lt;br&gt;• Thêm system activity “Store signed PDF” → system activity “Issue report and make reserved number official”&lt;br&gt;• Thêm system activity “Keep final internal approval bound to reviewed PDF” → system activity “Digitally sign the reviewed PDF”&lt;br&gt;• Thêm system activity “Store signed PDF” → system activity “Issue report and make reserved number official”&lt;br&gt;• Đổi đầu cạnh: system activity “Sign PDF” → system activity “Issue report” → system activity “Digitally sign the reviewed PDF” → system activity “Store signed PDF”" vertex="1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=17;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#111827;"><mxGeometry x="20" y="20" width="3620" height="900" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="cap_l" value="Trước" vertex="1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;alig